{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/init(_:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"(["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Entity"},{"kind":"text","text":"])"}],"roleHeading":"Initializer","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Swidux"}],"externalID":"s:6Swidux11EntityStoreVyACyxGSayxGcfc","title":"init(_:)","symbolKind":"init"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swidux\/entitystore\/init(_:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Creates a store pre-populated from an array (e.g. first-load hydration at app launch)."}],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"initialEntities"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Entity"},{"kind":"text","text":"])"}]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Does "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"not","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" record changes — the data is already persisted."}]},{"type":"aside","style":"important","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"first-load","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" hydration only. Do not use this initializer","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to “refresh from disk” mid-session by assigning into a live "},{"code":"EntityStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(e.g. "},{"code":"state.items = EntityStore(fetched)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" from a CloudKit re-hydrate action)."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"In-memory state may hold unflushed writes or live UI bindings; wholesale"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"replacement silently drops them and surfaces as lost keystrokes. Use","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/merge(from:shouldReplace:)","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" for that path — it records no changes and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"lets you decide per-ID which side wins. Under "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPersistentCloudKitContainer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the gotcha is especially sharp: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".NSPersistentStoreRemoteChange"},{"type":"text","text":" fires for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"local saves too, so a naïve “refresh on remote change” observer feeds the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app its own writes."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Important"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Entities sharing an ID are collapsed to the first occurrence. A store"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cannot represent duplicates — "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"positions"},{"type":"text","text":" holds one index per ID — and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"admitting them corrupts the index: the map would keep only the last"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"index while the array kept every copy, so "},{"code":"count","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" over-reports and a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"later delete orphans the earlier copy with no "},{"code":"positions","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" entry at all,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"leaving a row that is visible in "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/values"},{"type":"text","text":" but invisible to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/contains(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" and the subscript. Persisted rows can legitimately"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"share an ID (CloudKit forbids unique constraints), so this initializer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"has to be total rather than trusting its input."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/EntityStore/contains(_:)":{"title":"contains(_:)","role":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Whether an entity with this ID exists.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/contains(_:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"contains"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UUID","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/entitystore\/contains(_:)","kind":"symbol"},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/EntityStore":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EntityStore","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"EntityStore","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/entitystore","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An ordered, keyed collection of identifiable entities that silently records"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every mutation for downstream persistence."}],"kind":"symbol","title":"EntityStore"},"doc